Thus, \begin{align*}
\frac{\triangle ABM}{\triangle APB} & = \frac{\triangle ABM}{\triangle ABC}\frac{\triangle ABC}{\triangle APB} = \frac{1}{2}\cdot \frac{1}{2} = \frac{1}{4} \implies \\
\triangle APB & = 4 \cdot \triangle ABM.
